---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="about · thinkmorestupidless" current="about">
  <header style="padding: 48px 0 24px 0">
    <h1 class="display" style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 76px)">about</h1>
  </header>
  <div class="prose" style="max-width: 720px">
    <p>Trevor Burton-McCreadie. thinkmorestupidless is one person and the families of work that person keeps.</p>
    <p>This site is rendered from GitHub. The families, their repositories, their releases and when they were last touched are read at build time; the writing is markdown in the site's own repository. When a family tags a release, the site redraws itself.</p>
    <h2>what this is not</h2>
    <p>[Your own honest list: what you do not do, have stopped doing, or are not good at, in the same register as every repo's limitations page.]</p>
  </div>
</Base>
